<title>USA: Times Mirror completes sale of Abrams.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror completes sale of Abrams.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co on Wednesday said it has completed the sale of art book publisher, Harry N. Abrams Inc to Groupe Latingy, a French art and illustrated book publisher.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed, but Times Mirror will retain a minority equity interest in Groupe Latingy as part of the deal, it said.</p>
</text>
